# Burn checkpoints (also covered by checkpoints/ above)
*.mpk

# Generated corpora. Reproducible from the `dblocks geom data` line in
# docs/Geometric-Reasoning.md -- same flags, same seed, same bytes -- so a
# 2.5 MB binary that anyone can rebuild has no business in the history.
# The hand-written `.json` sidecars next to them are a different matter: a few
# hundred bytes each, they are inputs a reader needs to see, and `!geom*/*.json`
# below re-admits exactly those.
/geom/corpus.bin
/geom-hard/corpus.bin
!geom*/geom-meta.json
